flowchart TD
    Start([Start: ForwardQueryToTIC]) --> Input[/Input: admin_id, query_id, tic_id/]
    Input --> QUsers[(Query USERS & ROLE Tables)]
    QUsers --> CheckRole{Role == Admin?}
    
    CheckRole -- No --> Err1[/Return Error: Unauthorized/]
    CheckRole -- Yes --> QQuery[(Query D3: QUERIES)]
    
    QQuery --> CheckFound{Query found?}
    CheckFound -- No --> Err2[/Return Error: Invalid query reference/]
    CheckFound -- Yes --> QTIC[(Query USERS & ROLE for tic_id)]
    
    QTIC --> CheckTIC{Valid TIC reference?}
    CheckTIC -- No --> Err3[/Return Error: Invalid TIC reference/]
    CheckTIC -- Yes --> UpdateFields[Update assigned_tic & status]
    UpdateFields --> UpdateDB[(Update D3: QUERIES)]
    UpdateDB --> InitAudit[Initialize audit_record]
    InitAudit --> InsertAudit[(Insert into D7: AUDIT_LOGS)]
    InsertAudit --> Notif[Call DispatchNotificationAsync: TIC]
    
    Notif --> Output[/Return Success/]
    Output --> End([End])
    
    Err1 --> End
    Err2 --> End
    Err3 --> End